pageType: content
elements:
  - elementId: kicker
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 34, 300, 18]
    content: {style: "$kicker", wrap: false, text: 10 · Gas 优化}
  - elementId: title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 54, 840, 40]
    content:
      style: "$title"
      wrap: false
      text: 存储打包 + 减少跨合约调用，主线交易 Gas 下降 15%–21%
  - elementId: rule
    elementType: line
    bounds: [60, 102, 840, 1]
    viewBox: [840, 1]
    points: "0,0 840,0"
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$line"}
  - elementId: gas-chart
    elementType: chart
    bounds: [60, 124, 520, 340]
    data:
      cols: [交易, 优化前, 优化后]
      rows:
        - [上传发票, 219256, 173254]
        - [确认发票, 150356, 124931]
        - [申请融资, 171930, 145491]
        - [接受报价放款, 160852, 131343]
        - [兑付, 66008, 64043]
    series:
      - type: bar
        name: 优化前
        encode: {x: 交易, y: 优化前}
        fill: "#B9C2C9"
      - type: bar
        name: 优化后
        encode: {x: 交易, y: 优化后}
        fill: "$accent"
    legend: {position: top, fontSize: 12}
    yAxis:
      label: {fontSize: 11, numberFormat: "#,##0"}
      gridLine: {style: solid, color: "#EEEFF1", width: 1}
    xAxis:
      label: {fontSize: 12}
      axisLine: {style: solid, color: "#C9CFD4", width: 1}
      gridLine: false
  - elementId: vline
    elementType: line
    bounds: [610, 130, 1, 320]
    viewBox: [1, 320]
    points: "0,0 0,320"
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$line"}
  - elementId: s1
    elementType: text
    bounds: [640, 140, 260, 70]
    content:
      text: |
        <p><span style="font-size:28px;color:$accent"><strong>-10.2%</strong></span></p>
        <p><span style="font-size:12px;color:$gray">18 个函数平均 Gas（92,801 → 83,326）</span></p>
  - elementId: s2
    elementType: text
    bounds: [640, 230, 260, 90]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      text: |
        <p><strong>手段</strong>：存储槽打包（uint96 / uint64）、凭证元数据直接存 Token 减少跨合约读、去重键映射精简。</p>
  - elementId: s3
    elementType: text
    bounds: [640, 330, 260, 110]
    content:
      style: "$small"
      lineHeight: 1.6
      text: |
        <p>数据来源：contracts/docs/gas/，Foundry 基准测试，Sepolia 复测口径。</p>
        <p>优化后合约已重新部署，地址同步至前端与 ABI（提交 9d11af2 / d56bdc4）。</p>
  - elementId: footer
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 508, 400, 18]
    content: {style: "$small", wrap: false, text: SC6113 · 供应链金融 DApp}
  - elementId: page-num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [880, 508, 40, 18]
    content: {style: "$small", align: [right, top], wrap: false, text: "11"}
